    "faq_WT7f3T": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_PTJrBd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How does the GLO Wearable Breast Pump work?",
            "text": "<p>The GLO Wearable Breast Pump is a hands-free, hospital-grade pump that uses hospital-grade suction to express milk comfortably and effectively. Simply insert the pump into your bra, adjust the cups for comfort, and use the intuitive controls to customize your settings. The pump operates quietly and allows you to move around freely while pumping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_UyiqeJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Can I use the GLO pump for double pumping?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the GLO Wearable Breast Pump is designed for both single and double pumping. You can use one or both pumps depending on your needs, making it a versatile choice for busy moms.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_HeCVrf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How many suction levels are available, and how do I customize them?",
            "text": "<p>The GLO pump features 15 adjustable suction levels across four modes: Stimulation, Expression, Massage, and Auto. You can easily customize the suction using the intuitive controls to find the most comfortable setting for effective milk removal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_YVK7m7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Are different flange sizes available?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Every GLO pump includes 24mm flanges and soft flange inserts in 17mm, 19mm, and 21mm sizes. Additional sizes are available for purchase to help you find your most comfortable fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_wKMAtC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How long does the battery last, and how do I recharge it?",
            "text": "<p>The GLO pump provides up to 100 minutes of use on a full charge. To recharge, simply use the included USB charging cable. Charging is easy and convenient—just plug in between sessions as needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6L8nqw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Is the GLO pump discreet for use in public places?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the GLO Wearable Breast Pump is designed for quiet operation, making it easy to pump discreetly in public or around others. Its compact, lightweight design fits comfortably under clothing for a low-profile experience.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
